# Temperate ground cover (with Oak / Willow): a WIDE, low bramble mound - many arching canes from the ground, small
# dark leaf clusters along them (~0.8-1.3 m tall, ~4-6 m across). It fills the open floor between the trees with one
# piece where the round bushes need three: Weight 2, so half the climate's bushes are one.
